  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>(1) liquid dinitrogen is used in cryosurgery.</p><p>(2) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is diamagnetic in nature.</p><p>(3) it can not combine with dioxygen at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>&#186;</mo><mi>C</mi></math>.</p><p>(4) is correct</p>",
